{"suttaId":"tha-ap121","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5612,5642],"vripara":"72"},"segments":{"tha-ap121:0.3":"Paccupaṭṭhānasaññakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap121:1.1":"“Atthadassimhi sugate,","tha-ap121:1.2":"nibbute samanantarā;","tha-ap121:1.3":"Yakkhayoniṃ upapajjiṃ,","tha-ap121:1.4":"yasaṃ patto cahaṃ tadā.","tha-ap121:2.1":"“Dulladdhaṃ vata me āsi,","tha-ap121:2.2":"duppabhātaṃ duruṭṭhitaṃ;","tha-ap121:2.3":"Yaṃ me bhoge vijjamāne,","tha-ap121:2.4":"parinibbāyi cakkhumā.","tha-ap121:3.1":"“Mama saṅkappamaññāya,","tha-ap121:3.2":"sāgaro nāma sāvako;","tha-ap121:3.3":"Mamuddharitukāmo so,","tha-ap121:3.4":"āgacchi mama santikaṃ.","tha-ap121:4.1":"“Kiṃ nu socasi mā bhāyi,","tha-ap121:4.2":"cara dhammaṃ sumedhasa;","tha-ap121:4.3":"Anuppadinnā buddhena,","tha-ap121:4.4":"sabbesaṃ bījasampadā.","tha-ap121:5.1":"“So ce pūjeyya sambuddhaṃ,","tha-ap121:5.2":"tiṭṭhantaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap121:5.3":"Dhātuṃ sāsapamattampi,","tha-ap121:5.4":"nibbutassāpi pūjaye.","tha-ap121:6.1":"“Same cittappasādamhi,","tha-ap121:6.2":"samaṃ puññaṃ mahaggataṃ;","tha-ap121:6.3":"Tasmā thūpaṃ karitvāna,","tha-ap121:6.4":"pūjehi jinadhātuyo.","tha-ap121:7.1":"“Sāgarassa vaco sutvā,","tha-ap121:7.2":"buddhathūpaṃ akāsahaṃ;","tha-ap121:7.3":"Pañcavasse paricariṃ,","tha-ap121:7.4":"munino thūpamuttamaṃ.","tha-ap121:8.1":"“Tena kammena dvipadinda,","tha-ap121:8.2":"lokajeṭṭha narāsabha;","tha-ap121:8.3":"Sampattiṃ anubhotvāna,","tha-ap121:8.4":"arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","tha-ap121:9.1":"“Bhūripaññā ca cattāro,","tha-ap121:9.2":"sattakappasate ito;","tha-ap121:9.3":"Sattaratanasampannā,","tha-ap121:9.4":"cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap121:10.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe …","tha-ap121:10.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap121:11.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā paccupaṭṭhānasaññako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap121:12.1":"Paccupaṭṭhānasaññakattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2883,"to":2884,"paras":[{"para":2883,"vripara":"72","refs":["tha-ap121:1"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano puññakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>atthadassimhi sugate</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ heṭṭhā vuttameva.","<b>Yakkhayoniṃ upapajjin</b>ti ettha pana attano sakāsaṃ sampattasampatte khādantā yanti gacchantīti yakkhā, yakkhānaṃ yoni jātīti yakkhayoni, yakkhayoniyaṃ nibbattoti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap121:1"],["tha-ap121:1"],["tha-ap121:1"]]},{"para":2884,"vripara":"73","refs":["tha-ap121:2"],"lines":["<b>Dulladdhaṃ vata me āsī</b>ti me mayā laddhayasaṃ dulladdhaṃ, buddhabhūtassa satthuno sakkāraṃ akatattā virādhetvā laddhanti attho.","<b>Duppabhātan</b>ti duṭṭhu pabhātaṃ rattiyā pabhātakaraṇaṃ, mayhaṃ na suṭṭhuṃ pabhātanti attho.","<b>Duruṭṭhitan</b>ti duuṭṭhitaṃ, sūriyassa uggamanaṃ mayhaṃ duuggamananti attho.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap121:2"],["tha-ap121:2"],["tha-ap121:2"],["tha-ap121:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap121:1.1","atthadassimhi sugate",0,0],["tha-ap121:1.3","yakkhayoniṃ upapajjiṃ",0,2],["tha-ap121:2.1","dulladdhaṃ vata me āsī",1,0],["tha-ap121:2.1","duppabhātaṃ",1,1],["tha-ap121:2.1","duruṭṭhitaṃ",1,2]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
